09:37:33,902 --> 09:37:40,496
Alright, so the number of samples of class B is comparatively very less as class A, right?

8359
09:37:40,814 --> 09:37:44,900
So this is going to lead in poor performance in the minority class.

8360
09:37:45,454 --> 09:37:49,284
Basically, our model is going to be biased towards the majority class, right?

8361
09:37:49,454 --> 09:37:58,948
So, say for example, my model predicts not fraud or say normal each time, my model is going to be 98% accurate.

