8376
09:40:03,008 --> 09:40:10,340
And these data points have one rule that is, they are always going to lie between the axis of two existing data points.

8377
09:40:11,502 --> 09:40:14,884
Alright, so this is basically what Smort does.

8378
09:40:15,758 --> 09:40:20,128
So these are some of the techniques that you can use to handle your imbalance data.

