Now we already discussed gradient is going to lead us in the direction of maximum value.

8565
09:53:31,950 --> 09:53:35,472
And now gradient descent is a method to find the minimum of a function.

8566
09:53:35,694 --> 09:53:39,812
So obviously, gradient descent is going to move in the opposite direction of the gradient.

8567
09:53:40,078 --> 09:53:40,432
Alright.

