Alright.

8572
09:53:53,230 --> 09:54:09,412
Now, if the gradient is telling us that this particular direction is going to lead us to the minimum, and this particular direction is going to lead us towards the maximum, we are obviously going to move in the direction that is leading us towards the minimum.

8573
09:54:09,646 --> 09:54:09,872
Right.

8574
09:54:10,032 --> 09:54:17,284
And we are going to check that at each particular point until and unless we reach a point which is the global minimum.

