So the question goes: your features have values ranging from 1 to 10,000.

8860
10:16:04,910 --> 10:16:07,136
How would you prepare the data for machine learning?

8861
10:16:07,290 --> 10:16:08,036
All right.

8862
10:16:08,063 --> 10:16:14,052
Now, in order to prepare the data with features ranging from 1 to 10,000, you'll need to scale it.

8863
10:16:14,414 --> 10:16:21,284
Alright, so machine learning models work much better when features are on a similar scale, especially when ranges vary widely.

8864
